{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An exciting variety of 10 new fish from your collection from the Indian subcontinent! These will appear in an\u00a0<strong>in-game DLC store</strong> as well as appropriate existing stores for their species. Here\u2019s what you\u2019re getting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zebra Loach</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yoyo Loach</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Banded Archerfish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spotted Archerfish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Greenstripe Barb</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leopard Danio</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Red Robin Gourami</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scarlet Badis</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rosy Barb</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Odessa Barb</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537170/extras/Indian_Subcontinent_Collage.png?t=1744997468\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As always, all fish have had their behavior designed to match their real-life counterparts as closely as we can with our systems, but please feel free to reach out to us if you see anything funky.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please note: these fish will not all appear at once in your DLC store and will still be subject to random-spawning within the DLC store. The exact fish you want might not show up right away, but it shouldn\u2019t take long!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3537170?t=1744997468","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3537170?t=1744997468","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537170/3521532c33cb2ff5c6898e870ea24cdc2f19f8dc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744997468","capsule_i